            "name": "Rohan Mehta",
            "role": "Mumbai"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "The cotton yarn is genuinely good quality and the colours match the photos, which is rare when buying craft supplies online.",
            "name": "Priya Nair",
            "role": "Kochi"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Delivery to a small town in Rajasthan took four days and everything arrived intact. The handwritten note was a lovely touch.",
            "name": "Vikram Singh",
            "role": "Udaipur"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "I asked for a custom colour for a table runner and they sent swatch photos before starting. That kind of care is why I keep ordering.",
            "name": "Meera Krishnan",
